          "snippet": "The first experiments by Crooks were quite controversial because the detected forces had, in fact, thermophoretic origins. The actual radiation pressure force was demonstrated only years later by Lebedev [1] and Nichols [2]. Let us note that all these early developments were related to nonconservative forces (NCF).",
